' S-212 (olumlu yon): farkli rutinlerde, global/yerel ve kardes IF dallarinda ayni ad serbesttir; yalniz ayni kapsayicinin ikinci DIM'i reddedilir.
SUB A1()
    DIM x AS I32 = 1
    PRINT x
END SUB
SUB A2()
    DIM x AS I32 = 2
    PRINT x
END SUB
DIM g AS I32 = 5
SUB T()
    DIM g AS I32 = 7
    PRINT g
END SUB
A1()
A2()
PRINT g
T()
DIM n AS I32 = 2
IF n = 1 THEN
    DIM s AS STRING = "a"
    PRINT s
ELSE
    DIM s AS STRING = "b"
    PRINT s
END IF
